.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.trivyignore
Dockerfile*
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
# Never bake local terraform state, provider binaries or variable files into
# the image. Both tfvars forms, mirroring .gitignore: the flow this repo itself
# documents is common.tfvars.example -> common.tfvars under examples/, and
# `COPY . /app/pkg` would bake that file — with the account NRN in it — into a
# published image. *.tfvars.example is unaffected and still ships.
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
